    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">could you try it with test=&quot;Chisq&quot; argument? It is expected that p-values from highly variable methylation values will be squished. It is hard to tell if something will be significant just by looking at mean methylation difference. <div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Altuna </div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
