     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">yes, something along those lines. A scaling parameter is multiplied with the variation estimated by the binomial model. Scaling parameter depends on how much the methylation values diverge from the expected value from the model.<div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Altuna</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Jun 6, 2017 at 5:56 PM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">fothi...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
